'''Mage Guard''' is an NPC that patrols around {{zone|Scarleton}}. 

== Spawning ==
'''Mage Guards''' can be found patrolling {{Zone|Scarleton}} on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Behavior ==
If a player attacks the guard at least three times, the player will be attacked. When hostile, the '''Mage Guard''' has {{stat|hp|50,000,000}} and deals {{stat|dmg|20,000}}.

Once a player is targeted, the guards will chase all the way even into the upstairs of a building. {{PotN|Slowness}} splash potions can drastically obstruct their movement, useful when the player has difficulty on accessing merchant NPCs.

In a Barbarian rescue mission, if a bell near '''Mage Guard''' rings, the guards will be temporarily distracted and won't throw players out of the venue.

